 "title": "NEW PROPERTY TAX DEDUCTIONS • Blackford County, IN",
 "text": "NEW PROPERTY TAX DEDUCTIONS • Blackford County, IN\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nCommunity\nDepartments\nGovernment\nPrograms & Activities\nServices\nHome\nNews Flash\nNEW PROPERTY TAX DEDUCTIONS\nNews Flash\nNEW PROPERTY TAX DEDUCTIONS\nCounty News\nPosted on September 26, 2025\nThe Indiana Senate passed into law new property tax reforms for 2025-2026. Please review the new Tax Deductions to see if you qualify for any new deductions. Changes in deductions for 2025-2026 must be filed with the Auditor's Office by December 31, 2025.\n2025-2026 PROPERTY TAX DEDUCTIONS\nhttps://forms.in.gov/Download.aspx?id=6015\nRelated News\nBlackford County Food Access Locations\nCounty News\nPosted on October 08, 2025\nStay connected!\nCounty News\nPosted on May 08, 2023\nMeetings, Agendas & Minutes\nOnline Bill Pay\nForms\nFacilities\nRecords\nNotifications\n-->\nContact Us\nBlackford County\n110 West Washington Street\nHartford City, IN, 47348\nQuick Links\nBlackford Townships\nCommunity Directory\nFAQs\nVisit Blackford\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nAccessibility\nSite Map\nCopyright Notices\nContact Us\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
